0:["-I7cAKaR5Wzfc67K4RiE3",[[["",{"children":[["slug","horlicks-promo-voice","d"],{"children":["__PAGE__?{\"slug\":\"horlicks-promo-voice\"}",{}]}]},"$undefined","$undefined",true],["",{"children":[["slug","horlicks-promo-voice","d"],{"children":["__PAGE__",{},[["$L1",[[["$","script","schema-0",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$2"}}],["$","script","schema-1",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"@id\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/horlicks-promo-voice#breadcrumb\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"News & Blog\",\"item\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/voiceover-news\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Horlicks Promo Voice\",\"item\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/horlicks-promo-voice\"}]}"}}],["$","script","schema-2",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"VideoObject\",\"@id\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/horlicks-promo-voice#video\",\"name\":\"Horlicks Promo Voice\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/Hp8-la1KL6E/maxresdefault.jpg\",\"embedUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Hp8-la1KL6E\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Guy Harris\",\"url\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/voiceoverguy\",\"image\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/images/guy-harris-profile.jpg\"},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"VoiceoverGuy\",\"url\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/images/guy-harris-voiceover.png\"}},\"inLanguage\":\"en-GB\",\"description\":\"Horlicks Promo Voice - Without it's loyal drinkers around the world, we would never have made it to over 140 years old\",\"uploadDate\":\"2015-07-01T00:00:00+00:00\"}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Horlicks Promo Voice"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Proud to work with this great brand for the Horlicks Promo Voice. Celebrating 140 years. This Pathe News style fits quite nicely.</p>"}}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Check out the video</h2>\r\n<p>So, lets find out more about this iconic brand Horlicks. I get a lot of requests for the <a href=\"/pathe-news-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Pathe Voiceover\">Pathe</a> voice style. Mostly radio commercials. There is a really fun series of sketches on <a href=\"/https://www.jackfm.co.uk\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"JackFM\">JackFM </a> Oxfordshire in this style giving tips on everything British. This is so much fun to voice and it obviously comes with loads of nostalgia for that old BBC aesthetic. As this promo is so long and covers so much information, it's almost a hybrid between an <a href=\"/explainer-video-voice\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">explainer video</a> and a <a href=\"/commercial-voiceover\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">promo video</a>.\r\n</p>"}}],false,["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Hp8-la1KL6E","title":"Horlicks Promo Voice","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/horlicks-promo-voice.jpg","alt":"Horlicks Promo Voice","className":"blog-post-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<br>\r\n<h2>Horlicks Voice</h2>\r\n<p><em>With 140 years of rich history, <a href=\"/https://www.horlicks.co.uk\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Horlicks\">Horlicks</a> is proud to be the original malted milk drink containing 14 essential vitamins and minerals.</em> Most people who have grown up in the UK will have fond memories of drinking Horlicks, and it's safe to say that it's a national treasure. This video goes into some of  the brand's fascinating history and it was a pleasure to provide my Pathe News-style voice for the video.</p>"}}]]}],[],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Get in touch</h2>\r\n<p>If you are looking for a voice similar to this Horlicks promo voice, please do get in touch. Send me some of the script. I'll gladly send you a short voice a sample first to see if my voice is right for what you are creating. Tell me more about your project and let's see if we can work together!</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L4",null,{"pageTitle":"Horlicks Promo Voice","pageUrl":"horlicks-promo-voice"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-grid","children":[["$","$L3","525",{"href":"/joker-voice","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/joker-voice.jpg","alt":"Heath Ledger Joker Voice – Scary Halloween Voiceover","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"The Joker Voice"}]]}],["$","$L3",